Description: tiny Fumo desktop pet inspired by oneko
 OFumo is a lightweight desktop pet for Linux based on the movement
 behaviour of the classic oneko program.
 .
 It follows the pointer, provides idle and character animations, and supports
 both X11 and KDE Plasma Wayland through an additional KWin bridge.
